window.products.push({"id":659063,"name":"Perfect Fit | Fringed Throw Perfect for The Couch or Chair, Machine Washable, 40\"x70\", Seafoam Stripe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1H0j5+ZZAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Every throw blanket from Old Hampshire Yarns has a story to tell. The uniqueness of the material and the maker leave a one-of-a-kind signature on each blanket. And like snowflakes, no two are exactly alike. The intricate weave and handcrafted, natural appearance of our decorative throws is derived from our yarn - random in color and distribution - and how it is expertly drawn into the loom with great care and attention to detail. What you see and feel - beautiful, rich fabrics enhanced by the drape and hand of soft fibers - was designed and woven by craftsmen working on century old looms in the artisan studio at our mill in New Hampshire. How and where a product was made matters. You seek craft, community, and creativity, not a commodity. From the spinning of yarn to the weaving, the Old Hampshire Yarns throw is an American made original. With a commitment to deliver an authentic, American-produced product of unparalleled quality, comfort, and style, we help to preserve the quality and heritage of the American textile industry. Every one of our products helps to keep the story alive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1H0j5+ZZAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Fit","source_asin":"B07BPWFQN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BPWFQN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BPWFQN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659064,"name":"Westmark Germany Icing Sugar Shaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/219+wMZnbhL._AC_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY WITH TREND AND TRADITION Westmark of Germany is well known for its quality craftsmanship of kitchen gadgets. Westmark has been making reliable kitchen products for over 50 years. As a specialized and reliable partner Westmark offers a wide range of practical and uncomplicated kitchen products designed to make cooking and life in the kitchen easier. For traditional reasons, Westmark produces most of their products in Elspe, Germany. There, a team of long-year employees with a lot of experience in the plastic and metal production arranges that a huge quantity of reliable products is provided for sale every day. Their numerous tools and gadgets cater for virtually all possible food preparation needs in the kitchen. Products include spatulas, vegetable cutting & peeling gadgets, cheese slicers, meat hammers, fruit tools, fish preparation tools and scoops. Aluminium has been the traditional material used in the production of Westmark products; however, stainless steel and high grade plastic items now compliment the range. The recent introduction of a high quality silver metallic coating means that most products are now dishwasher safe. For kitchen products you can rely on, choose Westmark.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/219+wMZnbhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westmark","source_asin":"B0007VHCGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007VHCGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007VHCGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
