window.products.push({"id":659327,"name":"Lexicon Winona Swivel Chair, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":365.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916XFJ0Q-dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect addition to your casual living room, lexicon Winona Collection’s functionality goes beyond the traditional sense of seating group. A dark grey chenille fabric covers its modern silhouette, while the loose back cushions and nailhead trim further define its profile. This collection offers sofa chaise and barrel chair. The sofa chaise creates a bed with the beneath pull-out trundle raised up. Further functionality come in a form of hidden storage under chaise seat. The chaise and paired two-seater also offers in both right and left configurations to meet the needs of your space. A coordinating swivel chair lends complementing decorative accent with its barrel shape and reversible loose back cushion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916XFJ0Q-dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lexicon","source_asin":"B09PC836DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PC836DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PC836DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
