window.products.push({"id":659332,"name":"Gracious Living 5 Shelf Knect-A-Shelf Ventilated Heavy Duty Storage Unit 18 x 36 x 72 Organizer System for Home, Garage, Basement & Laundry, Black (3 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8131wBXqAKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY ASSEMBLE: Parts all snap together, no tools required, elevated from the floor AMPLE STORAGE: 5 ventilated shelves provide storage space in garages, basements, offices, and utility rooms STABLE SHELVES: Stable plastic shelves constructed with durable materials to hold up to 150 pounds per shelf and 750 pounds overall UNIQUE DESIGN: KNECT-A-SHELF feature allows you to connect to other shelf units (sold separately) for added storage DIMENSIONS: (L x W x H): 18 x 36 x 72 inches; Color: Black; Shelves: 5","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8131wBXqAKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gracious Living","source_asin":"B087JPZJZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087JPZJZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087JPZJZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659333,"name":"ThinkHat ChopTainer Cutting Board Space Saver, Meal Prep Storage, Salad Containers, Portion Control Cooking, Chopping, Measuring Cups, Organizer Bowls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816pw9svqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The food prepping process is a challenge starting from chopping vegetables on a cutting board to transferring chopped ingredients to the pots or pans. We are all too familiar with the problems including chopped ingredients leaving less room for other ingredients to be chopped, chopped ingredients including peels mixing with each other, the mess associated with transferring ingredients from the board to bowls and plates, lifting heavy cutting boards trying to transfer the vegetables to the stove, stress on your wrists, flimsy cutting board sets bending and making a mess while trying to do so, especially if transferring vegetables or fruits with juices. ChopTainer cutting board extension bins are here for solve exactly the above problems. These thoughtfully designed containers can be set flush to the cutting board edges, which makes it easy to sweep the ingredients directly into them as you chop them. There are measurement markings inside for you to know exactly how much you have chopped if you are following a recipe. They are designed like a dustpan so you can scoop the ingredients from the cutting board if you wish. Set of 3 ChopTainers also come with one with holes at the bottom, which can be used as a Colander to rinse veggies and fruits. The ChopTainers tip up to be used as a storage bin while the ingredients in them are waiting to be used for cooking. The inside of the ChopTainer is shaped so as to easily pour the ingredients it holds into the cooking utensil on the stove without making a mess - way better than holding the entire cutting board and trying to tilt it while selectively pouring the ingredients in. ChopTainer bins have a non-slip rubber base that provides nice friction on the countertop. ChopTainer is Dishwasher safe, BPA Free and made of food-grade material. Makes a perfect foodie gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816pw9svqEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThinkHat LLC","source_asin":"B01697IP7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01697IP7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01697IP7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
