window.products.push({"id":659436,"name":"2 Inch King Size Accu-Ease 4.3 Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper Made in The USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":345.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518caYYariL._AC_.jpg","description":"Accu-Ease 4.3 has been developed as the unique, new state of the art visco elastic memory foam. Accu-Ease 4.3 is manufactured and engineered to be the leading cushiony premium grade visco elastic memory foam and our new proprietary formulation makes Accu-ease more durable. The new Accu-Ease 4.3 visco elastic memory foam features a distinctive open cell formulation that makes it amazingly soft to the touch and more sensitive to your body, completely eliminating areas of tension and adding buoyancy. Accu-Ease 4.3 visco elastic memory foam will envelop your body in a luxurious, gravity free comfort zone that will result in a great restorative and rejuvenating sleep day after day and night after night for many years. The increased comfort you experience will allow you to arise, refreshed and ready to take on the day. That is because the extended durability of Accu-Ease allows it to resist painful pressure points better than conventional visco elastic memory foams. The result is enhanced, longer lasting comfort that fully satisfies your customers for many years. All our Memory Foam Mattress Toppers are made using Memory Foam produced in the USA, they are manufactured in our own factories, and are competitively priced while not compromising on quality. We do not import any of our memory foam products as we believe that US guidelines have an impact on quality and longevity. A visco elastic memory mattress topper from Accutex Foam USA could be the answer to your sleep problems. Many of our customers report dramatic improvements in their sleep patterns as a result of using our marvelous memory foam mattress toppers from Accutex Foam USA and we have a selection that will fit your individualized needs. Whether you need a visco elastic memory mattress topper for your bed, a guest bed or your child’s bed we have the size and comfort level to suit your needs. Memory mattress toppers are extremely easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518caYYariL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accutex Foam USA","source_asin":"B00BWAYE4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BWAYE4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BWAYE4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659437,"name":"(5x7) GATORGRIP Dual Surface Low-Profile Non-Skid Rug Pad for Hardwood Floors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nSCcy+NML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our rug pads are like gators: they grip strongly, last a long time, and are native to the USA. No matter what kind of flooring you have, GatorGrip Dual Surface offers a non-slip solution to all of your rug needs. Made from 100% recycled felt and natural rubber, these rug pads are designed to prevent sliding, slipping, bunching, and wrinkling and to protect your floor from damage. The textured natural rubber backing will not stain, mark, or discolor your floors. These pads are safe for any flooring surface provided manufacturer’s recommendations are followed and proper cure times are met. This GatorGrip pad is made in the USA and, at approximately 1/16” thick, will outperform and outlast similar waffle-styled PVC rug pads made overseas. You’ll rest easier knowing there’s a gator in the house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nSCcy+NML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GATORGRIP","source_asin":"B0BFBRRW5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFBRRW5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFBRRW5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659438,"name":"HOMICHEF 16 oz BLACK Stainless Steel Coffee Canister Airtight with Scoop, Date Tracker and 1-Way Air Valve - Medium Kitchen Food Storage Container for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51edB4RMdRS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"FRESH & FLAVORFUL COFFEE BEGINS HERE - This elegant stainless steel coffee canister features an airtight seal and a one-way air valve built into the lid which allows CO2 to escape, but won't allow air to enter as the sealer is closed onto the inlet when air comes from outside. - BONUS ITEMS include: 1.1oz Glass Travel Jar, Stainless Steel Scoop and 5 Replacement Air Valves. FOOD GRADE 304 STAINLESS STEEL AIRTIGHT CANISTER - Made of food grade 304 stainless steel with matte polished design, this coffee canister has a classic stylish effect, adding function & modern design to any place. - With excellent corrosion resistance, the canister is durable and always looks new.  - A silicone ring between the lid and valve is used to reinforce the sealed device to prevent air from the canister, so that coffee beans or grounds or ingredients won't get oxidized. DATE TRACK FRESHNESS FOR A DREAM BREW - The canister lid is also a date tracker. The inner wheel (numbers 1-12) is for months and the outer wheel (numbers 1-31) is for days, allowing for marking the storage date or the expiration date to track optimal coffee freshness.  - Can hold coffee beans, coffee grounds, dry tea-leaves, nuts, grains, flour, sugar, etc. FAQ 1. Before cleaning, dismount the valve from the lid by pushing it outward and keep the valve DRY. NEVER wash the valve.2. For coffee freshness, it is recommended to store the ground coffee for maximum periods of 6-9 months. ATTENTION 1. It is NOT recommended to store the coffee canister into a refrigerator or freezer.2. Set the months by lining up the number with the arrow on the lid. Please use TWO fingers to push down and turn at the same time. Enjoy COFFEE Enjoy LIFE :)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51edB4RMdRS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B08FLFQWY3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FLFQWY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FLFQWY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
