window.products.push({"id":659491,"name":"Thirteen Chefs Industrial Shelf Liners 36 x 18 Inch, 5 Pack Set for Wired Shelving Racks, Clear Polypropylene","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NC3+6Rw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"36 x 18 Inch 5-Pack When a sticky spill on a top shelf becomes an even bigger mess down below, it’s always gravity’s fault. But why fight gravity when you can prevent all manner of messes by adding these lightweight plastic liners to your wire shelves?  •Convenient storage solutions for use in warehouses, kitchens, workshops, walk in coolers  •Shelf liners are 100% polypropylene, a superior material to the more common polyethylene  • Liners are translucent, allowing light to pass through each level of storage so your inventory isn’t lost in the shadows  • Cutouts on corners ensure liners fit firmly and stay in place on shelving unit. No extra measuring required  • Flat surface prevents tipping and spillage","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NC3+6Rw8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thirteen Chefs","source_asin":"B07YF6ZB6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YF6ZB6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YF6ZB6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659492,"name":"5.7lb River Rock Stones Pebbles - Natural Decorative Polished Mixed Pebbles Gravel, Small Decorative Polished Gravel，for Plant Aquariums, Landscaping,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FSS+MhhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This river rocks comes in a variety of natural colors and patterns . Add an extra beauty in your outdoors: walkways, driveways, water features, ponds, water gardens, exposed aggregate flooring or walls and around swimming pools. Great accent for crafts: aquariums, rock gardens, succulent tillandsia plants, cactus pot, terrarium, bamboo plants and bonsai trees. Perfect for home decor projects: floral arrangements, centerpieces, vases, bowls, apothecary jars, wedding buffet, display canisters, pillar candle in hurricane glass. Decorative stone pebbles add beauty and protect your yard patio and lawn by keeping down weed growth. The beauty of natural stone is great for enhancing your landscape around trees, shrubs, flowerbeds, ponds and foundations.. Use these pebbles for landscaping around trees, potted plants decks driveways or yard. Natural pebbles are the perfect accents for many uses; Nature provides a sturdy, beautiful base for craft projects in a multitude of ways providing opportunities for creativity and exploration in the form of rocks and pebbles. Add these rocks to the bottom of any floral arrangements, or fill an empty vase for a tabletop accent, Pair with candles for a natural accent to any room. Caution: We do not offer guidance on the specific effect of this rock on your flora, fauna, etc. or how it will affect the water quality levels of pH, GH, alkalinity, ammonia etc. when in doubt discuss with a aquatic professional or a floral specialist before use. Before you add the rock into the aquarium vase or planter, please ensure that you wash them well to get rid of any surface chemicals, algae that may be present.Soak them in boiled water (don't boil rocks), brush and rinse well, or soak in a water solution, let it dry before use. ⚠ WARNING: CHOKING HAZARD - Small parts.Not for children under 5 yrs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FSS+MhhdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OUPENG","source_asin":"B0966PKRR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0966PKRR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0966PKRR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659493,"name":"Geloo Rectangle Mirror for Bathroom- 28 Inch Rustic Accent Galvanized Mirror Large Metal Wall Mounted Hanging Mirror for Wall Decor,Farmhouse,Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lmL0itX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ DECOR INDUSTRIAl ACCENT MIRROR: You'll love the urban Industrial look of this Accent Mirror. With gray tone edging, antique feel. Industrial Wall Mirrors will add a touch of one-of-a-kind decor to your home. Galvanized Rustic Mirror encapsulates timeworn beauty in all the best ways for your home. ✅ GALVANIZED METAL FRAME MIRROR: Modern Industrial Design. Made of High Quality Mirrored Glass, Crafted Galvanized Steel with an Antique Galvanized Metal Frame. The Galvanized Wall Mirror Features a crystal clear reflection and a lightly distressed galvanized metal frame and rust effect giving a vintage farmhouse feel. Clean with a soft, dry cloth for best care! ✅ EASY TO INSTALL: Geloo Mounted Wall Mirrors easy to install and hang! All mounting hardware and detailed instruction are included. The hooks are pre-installed behind the back panel and the package includes screws(Free gift). If you have any questions, please contact us and we will provide you with satisfactory service! ✅ VERSATILE USE WALL MIRROR: Hang above a bed, shelf, desk, or any indoor rooms for added aesthetic. Includes keyhole bracket hanger. Vertical hanging only. Measures 19.7\" W x 2.4\" D x 27.4\" H and is the perfect size for a Bathroom Vanity Mirror or an Accent Mirror for any wall in your home, this Decorative Wall Mirror providing a modern industrial style to your living room, bedroom, office, and entryway. ✅ Perfect Original Gift: Order this practical Geloo Decorative Wall Mirrors for yourself or as a thoughtful housewarming gift idea for a special friend, and you can be sure to win their appreciation. No need to waste your time with complicated mounting, as the mirror arrives ready for hanging. Wonderful gift for a loved one or yourself Ideal Gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lmL0itX-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geloo","source_asin":"B083BDJG89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083BDJG89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083BDJG89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
