window.products.push({"id":659532,"name":"Ginkgo International Leaf 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Place Setting, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyoV02H0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Ginkgo has been designing quality since 1977. A perfect example of this is our Ginkgo Leaf (by Ginkgo) 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for four. Our signature pattern, Ginkgo Leaf, is designed by Siro Tofolon and is elegant in design and feel. This 20-piece place setting includes four each of the following; salad fork, dinner fork, dinner knife, dinner spoon and teaspoon. Made in Korea of 18/0 Stainless Steel. Dishwasher Safe. Ginkgo. Made for your life. Amazon.com A wealth of artistic care and craftsmanship is evident in Ginkgo Leaf, the signature pattern of Ginkgo International. Created by renowned silver historian and designer Siro Toffolon, each piece displays a handle that curves fluidly to end in a beautifully formed fan-shaped ginkgo leaf. Every detail, from the depth of the spoon bowls to the angle of the fork tines, received Toffolon's meticulous consideration. Elegantly sized for fine dining and perfectly balanced, the flatware is crafted from mirror-polished 18/10 stainless steel for the utmost in luster retention. This 20-piece starter set of Ginkgo Leaf serves four diners. Each of the four place settings consists of a 9-1/2-inch dinner knife, 8-inch dinner fork, 7-1/4-inch salad fork, 7-1/2-inch soup spoon, and 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. A larger set and serving pieces are available separately to fully coordinate the table. The flatware is conveniently dishwasher-safe, although soaking in water and prolonged exposure to acidic foods should be avoided to prevent spotting. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 9-1/2-inch dinner knife; 8-inch dinner fork; 7-1/4-inch salad fork; 7-1/2-inch soup spoon; 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyoV02H0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B00THEYAI8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00THEYAI8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00THEYAI8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
