window.products.push({"id":659608,"name":"50th Birthday Decorations for Women,90 PCS Rose Gold 50th and Fabulous Birthday Decorations,Including Happy 50th Birthday Banner Backdrop,Crown,Hangin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817c1y06zZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"50th Birthday Decorations Kit: 1 Glittery 50th Birthday Tiara and 50th Birthday Sash,1 Happy 50th Birthday Banner, Numeral Foil Balloons in 5 & 0, 30 Pieces Latex Balloons,1 Table cloth,12 Plates and 12Tissue, 2 Foil Backdrop,6 Hanging Swirl,18 Photoshoot Props,1 roll glue, 1 roll ribbon. Great value 50th theme birthday party decoration set,enough to meet your different decorating needs, easily create a strong birthday atmosphere for your home. Larger 50th Birthday Banner: A large rose golds sign cheers to 50 happy birthday in 72.5 x 43.3 inches, the eye-catching 50th birthday backdrop is Made of high quality polyester fiber, washable and tear resistant. The happy 50th birthday banner has copper loops at the four corners that you can thread through using the included rope. Using these elegant banners and balloons can easily to create a perfect 50th birthday party for Wife, Mom, Friends and yourself. Numeral 50 Birthday Balloons+30 Pieces Latex Balloons: Large Numeral 50 Balloons in 40 inches.This Number Balloons are sturdy enough to stand long-hour display.10Pcs 12 inches rose gold printed balloons, 10Pcs 10 inches rose gold printed balloons and 10Pcs 10 inches pearl white balloons.Can be reused several times in different occasions. Glittery Birthday Crown/Sash+ 18 Photoshoot Props:Use rose gold flash curtain and background cloth as the perfect shooting background, wear the 50th birthday shoulder strap and 50th birthday crown printed on it, and make your photos durable through interesting prop photos! Bring your inner child out, with a funny beard, shining glasses and masks, and you will laugh from ear to ear. This will be a perfect way to take pictures at a party. Birthday Decorations Satisfaction Guaranteed: these 50 Birthday party decorations are very suitable for party photography backgrounds.Your 50 and fabulous decorations set comes with all pieces is carefully packaged. As soon as your decorations arrive, check it and tell us if anything is missing so we can replace it fast before your 50 Bday. If there is any flaw about our products, feel free to contact us to get a new one or get 100% refund at your choice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817c1y06zZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YeohJoy","source_asin":"B0C625P28W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C625P28W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C625P28W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
