window.products.push({"id":659878,"name":"EVERPRIDE Chef Knife Bag Holds 20 Knives PLUS Large Zippered Compartment for Kitchen Tools – Durable, Large Knife Bag for Chefs – Knives Not Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lY85xuYGL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"THE BEST CHOICE FOR PROFESSIONALS & STUDENTS: Whether you are a chef working in a professional kitchen or an aspiring culinary school student, this is a much needed accessory that you can’t do without. Don’t waste your money on flimsy, poorly made knife bags. Invest in the right kind of kitchen knife case and keep your expensive knives perfectly intact. PREMIUM QUALITY, DURABLE MATERIALS: Our professional chef knife bag is a great choice for everyone looking for a well-made knife carrying case to keep their cooking knives and kitchen utensils safely protected at all times. Made from durable and resistant 600D Polyester fabric you can be rest assured that our heavy-duty knife roll bag will prevent your knives from sliding or ripping your bag and provide the utmost safety, durability and lasting use. 3 LARGE SECTIONS FOR 20 KNIVES & EXTRAS: Our large knife bag for chefs is designed to cater for the needs of professional kitchen chefs and cooks. It features 3 large, separate storage compartments, 2 with slots for 20 chef knives and 1 zippered compartment with 3 inner zippers for storing your kitchen utensils and culinary tools. This protective knife carrying case can accommodate knives up to 20.5 inches in length. LIGHTWEIGHT DESIGN – Our knife bag for chefs weighs 2.5 lbs. but can comfortably hold over 25 lbs. worth of culinary equipment. Each knife roll features an adjustable shoulder strap and a carry handle which allows convenience and portability to carry your knives with ease and safety when going to work, culinary school, camping, or cooking demonstrations. SAFE AND SECURE: Each component of our chef knife bag is designed with safety in mind. Our thick polyester, high quality zippers, and protective straps are crucial in ensuring durability and to maximize safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lY85xuYGL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVERPRIDE","source_asin":"B07C8L1FH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C8L1FH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C8L1FH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
