window.products.push({"id":659892,"name":"Bright Zeal [Set of 3 Flamingo & Pineapple & Cactus LED Marquee Signs with Lights - Christmas Flamingo Decor Lights for Bedroom - Pineapple Decor Cact","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VSWlCKPjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"THE LED LIGHT LIGHTS UP YOUR HOME 1. Brightens your great home with a taste of tropics at daytime.2. Vivacious color with cute silhouette is sure to make your home more vibrant.3. LED bulbs begin to emit warm white glow, enjoying your warm and cozy home.4. Perfect for your wall, bed room, mantelpiece and table to add an elegant, relaxing glow to your lovely home. SIX-HOUR TIMER 1. Features Six-Hour Timer function, no need for manually operated.2. Can be left on for 6 hours and then remains off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically.3. If the light is manually operated to OFF when it is working, it will recount for timer after it is restarted.4. Timer function works when the light is on the ON position. FLEXIBLE & EASY DECORATING 1. Has a keyhole slot in back for easy hanging on walls.2. Also can be placed on a flat surface, leaning it up against a wall.3. No wires and no extension cords, only to flip ON/OFF switch (on the right side of the light).4. Battery Operated, 2 AA batteries are included. VERSATILE 1. For daily home decorations (wall, mantelpiece, table and bed room) to augment a snug glow to your home.2. For festival decorations (Christmas, Thanksgiving and friends-gathering parties) to increase happy accent.3. As a night light to comfort kids who are afraid of the dark. FAQs 1. The product is to be hung (has keyhole slot in back for easy hanging) on walls. If it is placed on a flat surface, please lean it up against a wall.2. ON/OFF switch is at the right side (ON turns on 6-hour timer). ATTENTION 1. Six-Hour Timer - The product can be left on for 6 hours and then remains off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically.2. INDOOR USE RECOMMENDED - If using outdoors, please place it under a covered area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VSWlCKPjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B06XYFZZGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XYFZZGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XYFZZGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":659893,"name":"Garbage Truck Throw Blanket, Green and Yellow Garbage Truck Pattern, 50x60 inch, Super Soft, Warm Kids Throw Blanket for Boys, Girls, Toddlers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19VwAgKbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Garbage Truck Throw Blanket, Green and Yellow Garbage Truck Pattern, 50x60 inch, Super Soft, Warm Kids Throw BlanketAttention Garbage Truck Loving Kids!A Message from the Garbage Truck Throw Blanket Designer:My 6 year-old son loves Thursdays because that's Garbage Day at our house. Every Thursday morning he wakes up and announces to the family, \"Happy Trash Day!\". He opens the blinds and waits patiently watching through the front window for the garbage truck to arrive. And thus, the idea for garbage truck throw blankets for children was born.We worked really hard to create a garbage truck throw blanket design that toddlers and kids would love. Your garbage truck loving child will be obsessed with this blanket, and snuggle with it every trash day!Garbage Truck Throw Blanket Details:A garbage truck throw blanket can be a striking design element, a dear memento, or simply an amazing accessory for refreshing afternoon naps. That's why this custom-printed Throw Blanket is the perfect snuggle friend for nap time. The soft silk touch fabric yields prints in eye-popping colors and the blanket is warm and cozy.Garbage Truck Throw Blanket Product Highlights:-100% polyester-Soft silk-touch fabric-Blanket size: 50″ × 60″ (127 × 153 cm)-Printing on one side-White reverse side-Machine-washable-Hypoallergenic-Flame retardant-Custom printed in the USA, original blank throw blanket sourced from China100% Satisfaction Guarantee: We want you to be 100% happy. If for any reason you are unhappy with your purchase, please kindly message us and we'll take care of your concern ASAP. We respond very quickly!Click \"Add to Cart\" to get your child's newest favorite Garbage Truck Throw Blanket Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19VwAgKbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happy Trash Day!","source_asin":"B09FKMQR6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FKMQR6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FKMQR6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
