window.products.push({"id":659897,"name":"Happy Birthday Gift Cake Candle - Beautiful Cute Cool 10 oz Bday Scented Candle ~ Looks Like a Real Cake ~ Presented in a Stylish Gift Box ~ 100% Soy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SJVwUiISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOU'LL BE HARD PRESSED TO FIND A BETTER BIRTHDAY GIFT: This is no ordinary birthday gift, or candle for that matter. Now instead of paying an arm and a leg for a birthday cake, you can give the birthday boy or a girl this one-of-a-kind handmade soy candle cake. HANDCRAFTED TO LOOK & SMELL LIKE A REAL BIRTHDAY CAKE: At first glance, you'll think this soy wax candle cake is a real birthday cake! Although this large cool candle looks just like the real McCoy it can't be consumed, but the fresh smells certainly will deliver huge smiles! Does Not Include glass tray and ribbon. NO GUILT ABOUT WOOFING DOWN A TON OF EXTRA CALORIES: With this unique birthday decor, you can \"have your cake and eat it too.\" It takes the place of an expensive real birthday cake and the candles that go on them. Plus, your waist will thank you the next day! BEAUTIFUL CAKE AROMA THAT WILL LAST FOR UP TO 24 HOURS: It's hard to put into words just how wonderful the smell of this birthday candle is. It has a magical way for brightening everyone's day. The happy birthday candle will have your entire house smelling like a birthday for up to 24 hours too! WE CREATE GIFTS THAT WILL LEAVE A LASTING IMPRESSION: At DaVinci Gifts, our goal is to create something truly memorable that will show a friend or family member just how much you care about them. We're always available if you have any questions, so don't hesitate to send us a message.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SJVwUiISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DaVinci Gifts","source_asin":"B0B7QXPKW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7QXPKW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7QXPKW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
