window.products.push({"id":659937,"name":"Jibin Bong Polyester Green Fabric Shower Curtain Ombre Shower Curtain Green and White with Steel Hooks, Ombre Green Shower Curtains for Bathroom Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a0U6vQBnL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"[Premium Polyester Fabric and 12 Strong Steel Hooks]: The fabric of the emerald green shower curtain is made of 100% premium polyester which is 120g per square meter ensures its heavy drapes and long-lasting use. We use 12 Strong Steel Hooks instead of ordinary plastic hooks for its luxury looking. This sage green shower curtain looked still new even you have used it for many years. [Waterproof, Quick Drying and Breathable]: This green gradient shower curtain is a waterproof shower curtain. The water will glide off easily from the lime shower curtain. The fabric will not soak the water. The olive green shower curtain works perfectly without a liner. 100% premium polyester makes it breathable and makes you enjoy the shower. [Perfect Decoration for Bathroom]: This shower curtain green is not only practical but also decorative. The inspiration of the design is the change of the leaf in Spring. The ombre color from light green to dark green just like the leaf change in Spring. It is a good choice as for a spring shower curtain. It can coordinate with any style and any color of your bathroom. It is also as a good choice as St Patricks day shower curtain, Easter shower curtain, rv shower curtain.. [Standard Size, High-end and Practical]: The fabric shower curtain 72 x 72 fits for standard tubs and showers. This ombre mint green shower curtain is customized with high-level heavy-duty polyester fabric which will not wrinkle easily that ensures its good shape and luxury look. The heavy-duty material also make the shower curtain seafoam green keep in place when water goes on while showering and the light green shower curtain will not blow to you even when there is wind. [Easy to use and Machine Washable]: This gradient shower curtain green has reinforced metal grommets for easy hanging and 12 strong steel hooks. This cloth shower curtain is a machine washable shower curtain, just toss the sage shower curtain in the washing machine for washing. The color will never fade up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51a0U6vQBnL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jibin Bong","source_asin":"B0BYDQ7QCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-659937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYDQ7QCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYDQ7QCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
